# Zack Fair: "attach an Equipment that was attached to Zack Fair to that creature." Skullclamp is attached to Zack (2/1: his counter
# and +1/-1). Sacrificing him for the Ornithopter: Skullclamp's own "whenever equipped creature dies, draw two cards" still triggers (he was
# equipped as he died, CR 603.10a) and the ability then attaches it to the Ornithopter, which becomes a 2/2 (0/2, the +1/+1
# counter, +1/-1). Hand: one Plains, one drawn for the turn, two from Skullclamp.

